      <details><summary>Are you a pest control company?</summary><p>No. PestControl Cyprus is a free matching service. We connect you with independent pest control providers, who carry out all inspections and treatments.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is the service free?</summary><p>Yes, our matching service is free for customers. We may receive a fee from the providers we work with.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How fast can someone come?</summary><p>It depends on your area and the season, but some providers can visit within a day or two. Your provider will confirm availability.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Are the treatments safe for children and pets?</summary><p>Your provider will explain which products they use and any precautions to take, such as keeping pets out of treated areas for a set time. Tell them about children, pets or allergies when they contact you.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do I need to be home during the treatment?</summary><p>Usually yes, at least at the start, so the provider can inspect the property. Your provider will advise you.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is there a guarantee?</summary><p>Many providers offer a follow-up visit or guarantee on certain treatments. Ask your provider about their terms when you get your quote.</p></details>
      <details><summary>I rent my home. Who pays for pest control?</summary><p>That depends on your rental agreement and the cause of the problem. Many landlords cover it, but check your contract.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you cover holiday rentals and businesses?</summary><p>Yes. We work with providers who service holiday homes, restaurants, hotels, offices and commercial properties.</p></details>
    </div>
